cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Haltere Pilot: a connectome-constrained flight controller"
message: "If you use this code, please cite it and the underlying connectome dataset."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Khan
    given-names: Ameer
abstract: >-
  A flight controller built from the Drosophila male CNS connectome, in which a
  simulated quadrotor's gyroscope is wired into the fly's haltere afferents and
  motor commands are read from real wing motor neurons. Includes ablation,
  reflex-arc and rewired-control experiments, and a real-time 3D viewer.
keywords:
  - connectome
  - Drosophila
  - neural control
  - halteres
  - imitation learning
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-09-20
